# Connectify

## Overview
Connectify is a real-time chat application built for seamless communication between individuals and groups. It provides instant messaging, temporary status sharing, video calling, user management, and real-time notifications through a modern, secure, and scalable architecture.

## Core Features

### Real-Time Communication
* Instant text messaging between users.
* Support for sharing images, videos, and files.
* Read receipts for message status.
* Persistent chat history.

### Status Updates
* Share updates using text, images, or videos.
* Configure status visibility using privacy settings.
* Automatically remove status updates after 24 hours.

### Video Calls
* High-quality audio and video communication powered by WebRTC.
